---
---

<section class="section bg-section" id="background">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="bg.eyebrow">Background</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="bg.title">
        A generation reaching the age where prevention matters most.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="bg.lede">
        Chinese-speaking adults aged 45&ndash;64, in mainland China, Hong Kong and Chinese
        communities worldwide, are entering the sub-health stage &mdash; and increasingly
        value preventive care rooted in <strong>Traditional Chinese Medicine</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-grid">
      <article class="stat">
        <div class="stat-big" data-i18n="bg.stat1.big">1.2B</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="bg.stat1.label">Chinese speakers worldwide</div>
        <p class="stat-detail" data-i18n="bg.stat1.detail">The world&rsquo;s largest single-language population &mdash; and the cultural home of Traditional Chinese Medicine (Ethnologue 2026).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="stat">
        <div class="stat-big" data-i18n="bg.stat2.big">45&ndash;64</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="bg.stat2.label">The sub-health window</div>
        <p class="stat-detail" data-i18n="bg.stat2.detail">The life stage where bodily function quietly declines and health awareness sharpens &mdash; exactly when preventive care matters most.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="stat">
        <div class="stat-big" data-i18n="bg.stat3.big">2.25M</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="bg.stat3.label">Hong Kong &mdash; our launch market</div>
        <p class="stat-detail" data-i18n="bg.stat3.detail">Adults aged 45&ndash;64 in Hong Kong, nearly a third of the city &mdash; our beachhead before expanding across Greater China (HK Population Projections 2022&ndash;2046).</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bg-section { padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 72px; }
  .section-head { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 56px; text-align: center; }
  .section-head .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .section-lede {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section-lede strong { color: var(--shiqing); font-weight: 500; }

  .stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .stat {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    border: 1.18px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 36px 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(107, 93, 79, 0.06);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    transition: transform 300ms var(--ease), box-shadow 300ms var(--ease);
  }
  .stat:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(107, 93, 79, 0.12);
  }
  .stat-big {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--shiqing);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .stat-detail {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .stat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .section-title { font-size: 28px; }
    .stat-big { font-size: 44px; }
  }
</style>
